<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 571.76, off 0.82.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 308 to 211.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,392,105, compared with 18,725,475 Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
